  "description": "Amazon operates businesses in shopping, cloud computing, AI, devices, entertainment, healthcare, and logistics. Its stores connect customers with products, while its operations network supports fulfillment and delivery. Amazon Web Services provides cloud infrastructure and services, including AI tools and custom chips. Consumer products include Alexa-enabled devices, Prime Video, Amazon MGM Studios, Amazon Music, Audible, and Twitch. Amazon also offers healthcare services through One Medical and Amazon Pharmacy. The company describes practical applications of AI across its shopping experiences, cloud services, and fulfillment network.",
